    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/9bc3e3278f252209128a8f309deb3a8c.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/9bc3e3278f252209128a8f309deb3a8c.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/9bc3e3278f252209128a8f309deb3a8c.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkfallen Survivors</strong> is a Roguelite survivor game where every run features unique skill and equipment drops, providing fresh challenges for each adventure. The game incorporates classic dark-themed systems like forging, shops, achievements, and sacred artifacts, experiencing endless battles and strategic combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect the Last Sanctuary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Elarion</strong>, high elves guided by starlight to these lands, have thrived for over ten millennia. Yet darkness festered deep beneath the earth, eventually corrupting the continent and transforming once-great heroes into the Darkfallen. Now the land lies broken, its peoples scattered. You\u2014the last survivor\u2014stand before the final sanctuary, wielding divine gifts against endless Demonic Hordes and challenging the Dark Lord, determined to restore light to this shattered realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blessings of the High Elves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six High Elves guard you throughout your journey, each bestowing unique abilities to help you craft a distinctive combat style in the dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/f8eb8e0df0736b0afef90e447ad9ca1a.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/f8eb8e0df0736b0afef90e447ad9ca1a.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/f8eb8e0df0736b0afef90e447ad9ca1a.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple hero selection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of heroes to choose from, offering different progression systems, unlocking skins, and having your own unique charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/1998f3187a384b0fd267f39825a0fbee.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/1998f3187a384b0fd267f39825a0fbee.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/1998f3187a384b0fd267f39825a0fbee.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vanquish the Dark Fallen, Forge Legendary Artifacts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into dark-themed exploration and combat, featuring loot drops, shops, and a forging system. Strengthen yourself through endless challenges and create your ultimate sacred artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3ced3a4adcc2fa542f13fd66d7b1d411.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3ced3a4adcc2fa542f13fd66d7b1d411.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3ced3a4adcc2fa542f13fd66d7b1d411.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge the Ultimate Skill Build, Face the Darkfallen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run places you in new crises, with over 40 powerful blessings to enhance your combat abilities rapidly. Build the ultimate skill set and face the Dark Fallen in a quest to protect the final sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/c1dbc23aa237d0c4a48d2b6d9762e69e.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/c1dbc23aa237d0c4a48d2b6d9762e69e.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/c1dbc23aa237d0c4a48d2b6d9762e69e.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More content awaits your discovery\u2014stay tuned!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/9bc3e3278f252209128a8f309deb3a8c.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/9bc3e3278f252209128a8f309deb3a8c.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/9bc3e3278f252209128a8f309deb3a8c.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkfallen Survivors</strong> is a Roguelite survivor game where every run features unique skill and equipment drops, providing fresh challenges for each adventure. The game incorporates classic dark-themed systems like forging, shops, achievements, and sacred artifacts, experiencing endless battles and strategic combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Protect the Last Sanctuary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Elarion</strong>, high elves guided by starlight to these lands, have thrived for over ten millennia. Yet darkness festered deep beneath the earth, eventually corrupting the continent and transforming once-great heroes into the Darkfallen. Now the land lies broken, its peoples scattered. You\u2014the last survivor\u2014stand before the final sanctuary, wielding divine gifts against endless Demonic Hordes and challenging the Dark Lord, determined to restore light to this shattered realm.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blessings of the High Elves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six High Elves guard you throughout your journey, each bestowing unique abilities to help you craft a distinctive combat style in the dark world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/f8eb8e0df0736b0afef90e447ad9ca1a.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/f8eb8e0df0736b0afef90e447ad9ca1a.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/f8eb8e0df0736b0afef90e447ad9ca1a.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiple hero selection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of heroes to choose from, offering different progression systems, unlocking skins, and having your own unique charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/1998f3187a384b0fd267f39825a0fbee.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/1998f3187a384b0fd267f39825a0fbee.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/1998f3187a384b0fd267f39825a0fbee.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vanquish the Dark Fallen, Forge Legendary Artifacts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into dark-themed exploration and combat, featuring loot drops, shops, and a forging system. Strengthen yourself through endless challenges and create your ultimate sacred artifact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3ced3a4adcc2fa542f13fd66d7b1d411.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3ced3a4adcc2fa542f13fd66d7b1d411.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/3ced3a4adcc2fa542f13fd66d7b1d411.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge the Ultimate Skill Build, Face the Darkfallen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run places you in new crises, with over 40 powerful blessings to enhance your combat abilities rapidly. Build the ultimate skill set and face the Dark Fallen in a quest to protect the final sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/c1dbc23aa237d0c4a48d2b6d9762e69e.poster.avif?t=1750587952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/c1dbc23aa237d0c4a48d2b6d9762e69e.webm?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201450/extras/c1dbc23aa237d0c4a48d2b6d9762e69e.mp4?t=1750587952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More content awaits your discovery\u2014stay tuned!</h2>",
